        "insufficient_evidence": false,
        "summary": "Mann describes a risk-tiered process: estimate societal risk at each level of model capability, test concerning capabilities in controlled settings, and communicate findings so others— including legislators—understand the risks.",
        "summary_citation_ids": [
          "S1",
          "S2",
